    "module_designation": "Non-automatic weighing indicator",
    "description": "Non-automatic weighing indicator (models 195 and 225). Devices: semi-automatic zero-setting, automatic zero-tracking, initial zero-setting, semi-automatic subtractive tare, preset tare, net/gross indication, extended resolution, printing (external printer connected to interface), alibi memory (option), units (g, kg, t). Interfaces: USB (1x micro USB-B, 1x USB-A), logic-level inputs, eight logic-level outputs, analogue output (0 to 10 V or 4-20 mA), Ethernet LAN, wireless interfaces (Wi-Fi and Bluetooth), two serial ports (RS232/20 mil and RS232/485 connectivity), option cards. Software is segregated into parts; the legally relevant part includes boot loader, standard indicator and streaming of weighing results to RS232 or Bluetooth. Software revision displayed during power-up as XX.YY.ZZZ where XX is the version of the legally relevant software."
